page SessionPage
  Section id:"session-introduction" py:{ xs:6 md:10 }
    Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:"1fr auto" } gap:5 align:"end"
      Grid columns:1 gap:3
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "SERVER / SESSIONS"
        Title size:{ xs:"3xl" md:"6xl" } weight:"black"
          "Opaque sessions"
        Text size:"lg" color:"muted"
          "Bearer describes how a credential travels. It does not require JWT. Dowe's CRUD template uses a server-owned ULID session backed by Cache and Database."
      Button href:"/docs/server/kv" variant:"ghost" scheme:"muted" size:"sm"
        "Cache documentation"
  Section id:"session-mental-model" p:{ xs:5 md:7 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "MENTAL MODEL"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Use an opaque ULID as the session id"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "id session source:\"ulid\" generates a canonical 26-character ULID on the server. The client receives only the opaque id and sends it as Authorization: Bearer <ulid>. Claims and database credentials never enter the token."
      Code:
        language:"dowe"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"surface"
        copyLabel:"Copy Dowe"
        copiedLabel:"Copied"
        content:"""
          fn createSessionRepository params:{ userId:string }
            id session source:"ulid"
            query created db:appDb.insert table:"sessions" value:{ id:session userId:args.userId createdAt:now } required:["id", "userId"]
            str sessionKey source:"join" values:["session", session] delimiter:":"
            kv cached conn:appCache.set key:sessionKey value:{ id:session userId:args.userId }
            return value:{ id:session userId:args.userId }
        """
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:3 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "TOKEN"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "ULID"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Random, opaque, sortable, and without readable claims."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "CACHE"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Fast hit"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "session:<ulid> stores only the server-owned session projection."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "DATABASE"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Source of persistence"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "A Cache miss reads sessions and rehydrates the projection."
  Section id:"session-validation" py:{ xs:7 md:10 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "MIDDLEWARE"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Validate Cache first, then Database"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "session.verify rejects malformed or expired ULIDs, checks Cache, falls back to the sessions table, and returns valid:false when the session is absent. Only verified data should reach next context."
      Code:
        language:"dowe"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"surface"
        copyLabel:"Copy Dowe"
        copiedLabel:"Copied"
        content:"""
          import { appDb, appCache } from "@/server/config/database"

          middleware requireBearer
            bearer token value:req.header.Authorization
            session verified cache:appCache database:appDb token:token maxAge:2592000
            if verified.valid
              next context:{ auth:{ subject:verified.userId session:verified.id authorization:req.header.Authorization token:token } }
            return status:401 json:{ ok:false error:"Unauthorized" }
        """
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:3 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
            "1. Cache hit"
          Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
            "The session projection is validated and the request continues without reading the persistent database."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
            "2. Cache miss"
          Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
            "The database record is checked. A valid record is copied back to Cache for the next request."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
            "3. Reject"
          Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
            "Missing, malformed, expired, or revoked sessions receive HTTP 401 and never populate request context."
  Section id:"session-lifecycle" p:{ xs:5 md:7 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "LIFECYCLE"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Expiration and logout are stateful"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "The default CRUD maxAge is 30 days. Runtime checks the ULID timestamp on every validation. Logout deletes both session:<ulid> from Cache and the matching sessions record, so revocation is immediate."
      Code:
        language:"dowe"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"surface"
        copyLabel:"Copy Dowe"
        copiedLabel:"Copied"
        content:"""
          fn logoutUserService params:{ session:string }
            deleteSessionRepository deleted args:{ id:args.session }
            return value:{ authenticated:false guest:true authorization:"" token:"" }
        """
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:2 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
            "Cache is acceleration"
          Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
            "Cache improves latency but is not the only authority. Database fallback keeps sessions recoverable after Cache restarts."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
            "Revocation is explicit"
          Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
            "Delete the Cache key and persistent row when logging out, banning a user, or rotating all sessions."
  Section id:"session-jwt-choice" py:{ xs:7 md:10 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "DESIGN CHOICE"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "When should you use JWT?"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "Use opaque sessions when you already have shared state and need immediate logout, permission changes, or per-device session control. Use JWT when independent services must verify a signed assertion without calling a shared session store, and pair it with short expiry or a revocation strategy."
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:2 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
            "CRUD recommendation"
          Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
            "Keep the generated Bearer credential opaque. The Dowe runtime owns session validation, expiry, Cache-aside rehydration, and revocation."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
            "JWT remains available"
          Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
            "Dowe still supports JWT as a general server utility for integrations that need signed or encrypted tokens. Bearer is the transport scheme, not the token format."
